        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Say goodbye to harsh cleansers",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text": "<p>Ditch the harsh cleansers that leave your skin feeling tight and dry. This 100% natural foaming cleanser creates a rich, luxurious lather that effectively lifts away impurities while preserving your skin’s natural moisture. </p>",
